    "description": "The history of the Arabs in the Near East and the Middle East before the advent of Islam is now available. Arabs and Empires before Islam, published by the Oxford University Press, contains commentary and analysis from more than 20 international experts, including Dr Philip Wood, Associate Professor at Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations.",
